{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15593","headline":"春霁晚望 · 杨凝","name":"春霁晚望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细雨晴深小苑东，春云开气逐光风。\n雄儿走马神光上，静女看花佛寺中。\n书劒学多心欲嬾，田园荒废望频空。\n南归路极天连海，惟有相思明月同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}